  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_01",
      "hash64": "C7790065D9074083",
      "text": "Oh, mais c’est my dear [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_02",
      "hash64": "C7790165D9074236",
      "text": "Comme tu peux le voir, mon petit Pohm\\ndéborde d’énergie ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_poke_01",
      "hash64": "9D5A184D2E32E9B1",
      "text": "...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_03",
      "hash64": "C7790265D90743E9",
      "text": "Ha ha ha ! Bon, il n’est pas très bavard,\\nmais c’est comme ça. Chacun sa personnalité ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_04",
      "hash64": "C7790365D907459C",
      "text": "Mais j’ai peur qu’il ait du mal à communiquer\\navec les autres Pokémon s’il ne s’exprime pas.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_05",
      "hash64": "C7790465D907474F",
      "text": "Les Pokémon sauvages se transmettent beaucoup\\nd’informations grâce à leur cri, comme\\r\\nla présence de nourriture ou d’un prédateur.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_06",
      "hash64": "C7790565D9074902",
      "text": "Cela signifie que si ce petit cœur retournait à la\\nvie sauvage, il serait incapable d’en faire autant...[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_poke_02",
      "hash64": "9D5A154D2E32E498",
      "text": "...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_07",
      "hash64": "C7790665D9074AB5",
      "text": "Je voudrais prendre la meilleure décision\\npossible pour lui. Qu’est-ce que je devrais faire,\\r\\nd’après toi ?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_select_01",
      "hash64": "4C9EA760060359BA",
      "text": "Et s’il restait ici ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_select_02",
      "hash64": "4C9EA66006035807",
      "text": "Et si vous le gardiez, monsieur Salvio ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_08a",
      "hash64": "F9F39B0FC766334B",
      "text": "Ici ? Tu veux dire à l’académie ?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_08b",
      "hash64": "F9F39C0FC76634FE",
      "text": "Sorry ? Oh, je ne m’attendais pas\\nà cette réponse...[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_09",
      "hash64": "C7790865D9074E1B",
      "text": "Mais oui, après tout, peut-être qu’il ferait mieux\\nde rester à mes côtés ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_10",
      "hash64": "C77C0565D9097ED9",
      "text": "Au départ, je ne pensais qu’à le soigner\\net à le remettre en liberté. Je n’avais donc\\r\\nmême pas envisagé cette solution.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_11",
      "hash64": "C77C0465D9097D26",
      "text": "Qu’en penses-tu, mon cher petit Pohm ?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_poke_03",
      "hash64": "9D5A164D2E32E64B",
      "text": "...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_poke_04",
      "hash64": "9D5A1B4D2E32EECA",
      "text": "Pohm.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_12",
      "hash64": "C77C0365D9097B73",
      "text": "Oh ! Il a parlé !\\nC’est fantastique ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_13",
      "hash64": "C77C0265D90979C0",
      "text": "Même sans comprendre le langage des Pokémon,\\nje peux affirmer que sa réponse était un « oui »\\r\\nretentissant ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_14",
      "hash64": "C77C0965D90985A5",
      "text": "Thank you very much, my dear [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_16",
      "hash64": "C77C0765D909823F",
      "text": "Je ne sais pas si on peut appeler ça un cadeau,\\nmais tiens ! Voici un Pokémon rare pour toi ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_system_02",
      "hash64": "652DA48DF72792D4",
      "text": "Monsieur Salvio vous confie un Miaouss !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_15",
      "hash64": "C77C0865D90983F2",
      "text": "Tu peux compter sur moi pour prendre le plus\\ngrand soin de Pohm ![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_system_01",
      "hash64": "652DA78DF72797ED",
      "text": "Vous avez réussi à nouer des liens forts\\navec monsieur Salvio !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
